---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Adverax is a niche marketplace for software components powering home energy systems. This blog is the project's open front."
>
  <article class="prose prose-gray max-w-none prose-a:text-brand-600">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>Adverax</strong> is a niche marketplace for software components
      used in home energy management — hardware drivers (inverters, batteries,
      heat pumps, EV chargers) and data providers (tariffs, generation
      forecasts, weather).
    </p>
    <p>
      This blog is the open part of the project: field notes on building
      systems that hold where they're not allowed to fail — from home energy
      to the way software itself gets built, one layer up from any product.
      The verified-integrations catalog is in development.
    </p>
    <h2>Launch updates</h2>
    <p>
      An email signup will appear here once the mailing service is wired up.
      For now, follow updates via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
